 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "Raza Khan, at your service. The Nayak of Madurai sends his horse as promised.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "madurai_troop",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "We have fought for Madurai and for your king before.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "madurai_troop",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We begin with the simple release. Ride to the water's edge. Turn. Ride back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not let the hoof slide.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "We did not ride from Madurai to school our mounts like children on their first pony.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "My men ride to break lines, not to dance with crabs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Your men ride on hard earth. Here the ground lies to you. It looks firm, but it drinks the hoof.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "If you charge a Dutch square and your horse stumbles on the turn, you are not a soldier, you are a target.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "One pass. To show you there is no magic in sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ponnan",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "See? The earth here judges weight. It punishes force.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "madurai_troop",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "This earth has judged hooves longer than you have ridden, Deccan man.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "We learned that under other kings.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then teach your Madurai friends. Today they followed me into the bog. Tomorrow they follow you around it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "We will see whose tricks the Dutch remember.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is a bog. No cavalry can fight here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch will be here. If you cannot fight where they stand, why did you take the king's coin?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Again. But this time, do not fight the ground.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Let the horse find the bottom before you ask for the turn. You must ride with the sand, not against it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "This is not war. This is labour.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It is the only war that matters today.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch carry muskets that fire in volleys. Precise. Mechanical. If you charge them straight, they will break you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You must come at them like the tide. Fast, from the angle they do not expect, and gone before they can reload.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "To ride like the tide, one must first not drown in the sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Exactly.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch line.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Us. We do not hit them. We bait them.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We ride close, close enough to make them level their muskets. Then we turn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If we slip then, we die.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If we turn true, they fire at ghosts, and while they reload, we take them with the sabre.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is a gamble. To ride into the teeth of the gun and turn away.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It is better than riding into the teeth and staying there.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN (small)"
   ],
   "text": "If the horses hold.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Make them hold.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You make them move like fish. Not like bulls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Fish do not charge muskets. But yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If your enemies expect bulls, better to be something else.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They are not yet ready. But they are less foolish than they were at sunrise.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "madurai_troop",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They obeyed you. Even when their pride bucked harder than their horses.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They obeyed the king's order. I am only the voice today.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Voices matter. Especially when the sea is loud.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch think these sands belong to them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They think their boots and bayonets make them owners.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Show me, Nagoji Sawant, that horses can disagree.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will try.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You do not belong to any of them either. Do you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Kayal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You will learn the sand with me. And when the Dutch come, we will show them what a backwater horse can do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You talk to horses. I have seen men talk to worse.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Horses do not argue. They simply refuse, or they follow. It is simpler than men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You are Hindu.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "After a fashion. The Portuguese tried to convince me otherwise. It did not take.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "And yet I have seen you bow your head in their churches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I pray to whatever is listening. If the gods are as numerous as men say, surely one of them has time for a cavalryman with sand in his boots.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "I am Muslim. My fathers came from the coast of Arabia, traders who married local women and stayed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "We built mosques. We kept the faith. But we also lit lamps at Hindu shrines when our ships sailed, and we asked Christian priests to bless our cargo when the winds were wrong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "On this coast, the gods mix like the waters of the backwaters, salt and fresh, never quite one thing. A man who insists on purity drowns faster than one who learns to float in both.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You are useful too, Sawant. That is why you are still alive.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The king does not keep men for their faith. He keeps them for what they can do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Remember that, when you wonder why a Muslim sailor and a Hindu horseman and a Christian merchant all sit in the same war hall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
}